ies).\", \"\"], \"relatedness_rating_scale\": [\"Use any value in the range of 0 to 100 in relatedness rating scale.\", \"**0** signifies the words are **not at all related**.\", \"**100** signifies the words **very highly related**.\", \"Intermediate values between 0 and 100 denote intermediate values.\", \"Relateness value is **stricity defined in the **range of 0: not related at all, TO 100: very highly related**.\", \"**ALWAYS FOLLOW THESE INSTRUCTION**\"], \"type\": \"number\"}}}",
